  "name": "Thrown Weapon Master",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/symbols/question-stone-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have mastered the ability to throw weapons from a distance. You gain the following abilities:</p><ul><li>Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>Simple and martial melee weapons without the thrown property have the thrown property for you. One-handed weapons have a normal range of 20 feet and a long range of 60 feet, while two-handed weapons have a normal range of 15 feet and a long range of 30 feet.</li><li>When you make an attack with a thrown weapon that already had the thrown property (not gained by this feat), the standard range is 60 and the long range is 180.</li></ul>",
